      "message": "The code calling these methods is not in this patch though, we need the methods to set/get our extended attributes. To call this methods, we may need to change more places through the both filesystems. All the changes in the patch is very essential for our feature. Somehow we have to develop a sort of interface for our feature to be used in common android.",
